            </li>
            <li>
              <a
                href="https://spacephysics.princeton.edu/sites/g/files/toruqf1376/files/documents/brandt_2023.pdf"
                >APL’s Interstellar Probe study</a
              > supplies the 7 AU/year comparison. The chart uses Julian years of
              365.25 days. The other speeds are arithmetic illustrations.
            </li>
            <li>
              The title is from “Tomorrow” in <cite>Annie</cite>, with music by
